+## Rework — merge-queue index lock, 2026-10-11
+
+This rejection happened after the queue completed its compile/test validation, at the final integration fast-forward: Git could not create the main worktree's `.git/index.lock`. The queue had committed the previous rework as `ed6b9c1bf83b430dabb74c8acbd5ba94b51f53a6`; the integration branch was still `9247cc397d929a21e9abba721ad963a4410a7d2b`. Ran `git -c user.name=Claude -c user.email=noreply@anthropic.com merge --no-commit claude/sleepy-franklin-egimjb`; it returned `Already up to date.` Both fixes from the previous merge are already preserved. [Merge output](bugfix-develop-validation/rework-2/merge.log), [queue rejection](bugfix-develop-validation/rework-2/land-failure-excerpt.log).
+
+The blocking index lock was zero bytes and more than two hours old. Inspected its inode and timestamp and checked for both active Git processes and open descriptors twice; neither check found an owner. Archived that exact unchanged lock to `bugfix-develop-validation/rework-2/stale-index-lock.zero-byte`, freeing the main worktree index for the queue. The index itself and the integration branch were not modified. [Inspection](bugfix-develop-validation/rework-2/index-lock-inspection.json), [recovery audit](bugfix-develop-validation/rework-2/index-lock-recovery.json).
+
+No Rust source, test assertions, time limits or expected results are changed in this rework. The queue logged one mock-Comfy test that passed on retry; it is included unchanged in the fresh focused validation below. No new TEST-CHANGED declaration is needed.
+
+All Cargo commands use matching upstream Rust 1.98.1 and Clippy: `RUSTC=/home/zdavidson/.rustup/toolchains/1.98.1-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu/bin/rustc`, `CARGO_TARGET_DIR=target/rework-clippy-rustup`, and the required existing `RUSTC_WRAPPER=/home/zdavidson/.local/share/local-image-dev/bin/li-rustc-gate`. `CARGO_BUILD_JOBS` remains unset. Validation runs one Cargo command at a time, offline. [Environment](bugfix-develop-validation/rework-2/environment.json), [exact argument vectors](bugfix-develop-validation/rework-2/commands.json), [validation runner](bugfix-develop-validation/rework-2/revalidate.py). No GUI windows were opened and no Local Image, ComfyUI or other job process was stopped.
